status+='## Compatibility and evidence\n\nExisting projects remain schema koma.production/1. Opening alone does not rewrite. Pro operations mark minimumEditor=0.5.0. Do not resave Pro projects in older editors.\n\nCurrent acceptance: evidence/v050/test-report.json. Browser tests use full offline HTML, and actual loopback HTTP/CLI/MCP are tested separately. No live Codex, physical tablet or long-form production certification.\n'
